  "text": "Skip to content\n✦\nSaint Demetrios Greek Orthodox Church\nUNION\nWorship\nCommunity\nVisit\nContact\nGive →\n\nFAITH · COMMUNITY · UNION\n\nThere is a place\nfor you here.\n\nGreek Orthodox parish in the Metropolis of New Jersey.\n\nPlan your first visit\n↗\nWorship & media →\n←\n1 / 10\n→\n\nA LITTLE PREPARATION\n\nYour visit,\nat your pace.\n\nKeep a personal checklist for your visit. This stays on this device; it is not sent to the parish or used as a reservation.\n\nConfirm service or programme times with the parish.\nAsk the office about accessibility or family needs.\nKeep directions and the parish phone number handy.\nI’m interested in\nWorship & a first visit\nFamily & Greek culture\nVolunteering & giving back\nFinding community\nMy planned visit date\nSave my personal plan\n\nBELONG IN YOUR OWN WAY\n\nLet’s find your next step.\n\nFaith, language, service and friendship. Explore programmes managed by the parish.\n\nFind a ministry\nYour interest\nAll ministries\nFaith & learning\nFamily & culture\nGiving back\nCommunity\nFind my next step\n\nNo ministry matches that search. Try another interest or contact the parish office.\n\nExplore programme summaries here. Official registration is handled by the parish. No children’s information is collected here.\n\nGATHER WITH US\n\nMake time for what matters.\n\nCheck the parish’s current schedule before travelling. Confirm local service times directly with the parish.\n\n01\nWorship calendar\n\nServices, feast days and changes to the usual schedule.\n\nExplore worship dates →\n02\nCommunity calendar\n\nFind parish gatherings and community activities.\n\nExplore community dates →\n03\nUpcoming gatherings\n\nSee upcoming gatherings shared by this parish.\n\nCheck published dates\n\nA GLIMPSE INSIDE\n\nBeauty that welcomes you.\n\nPhotographs from Saint Demetrios Greek Orthodox Church’s profile and official website.\n\nSaint Demetrios Greek Orthodox Church · published photograph ↗\nSaint Demetrios Greek Orthodox Church · published photograph ↗\nSaint Demetrios Greek Orthodox Church · published photograph ↗\nSaint Demetrios Greek Orthodox Church · published photograph ↗\nSaint Demetrios Greek Orthodox Church · published photograph ↗\nSaint Demetrios Greek Orthodox Church · published photograph ↗\nSaint Demetrios Greek Orthodox Church · published photograph ↗\nSaint Demetrios Greek Orthodox Church · published photograph ↗\nSaint Demetrios Greek Orthodox Church · published photograph ↗\nSaint Demetrios Greek Orthodox Church · published photograph ↗\n\nNEAR OR FAR\n\nStay connected\nto worship.\n\nExplore parish photographs and published worship information.\n\nExplore worship & media →\nx ↗\nfacebook ↗\ninstagram ↗\n\nYOUR PARISH, YOUR NEXT STEP\n\nWe’ll help you\nfind your way.\n\n721 Rahway Avenue, Union, NJ 07083\n\nCall 9089647957\nGet directions\n↗\n\nOfficial contact information ↗\n\nA question for the parish?\n\nAsk about visiting, accessibility, programmes or sacramental arrangements directly. An enquiry is not a booking.\n\nCheck private enquiries on Zoi\n\nSupport parish life\n\nGiving is handled by the parish and its chosen provider. Zoi does not collect a payment here.\n\nWays to support parish life →\nSaint Demetrios Greek Orthodox Church\nFaith. Heritage. Belonging.\nOfficial parish website ↗\nParish home on Zoi\nShare this page\nParish owner tools\nParish management & source notes\n\nPowered by Zoi.",
